<element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>40</x><y>460</y><w>640</w><h>160</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Legend
--
Blue bar = Dev1   Green bar = Dev2   Purple bar = Dev3   Orange bar = all 3 devs
Red outline = critical path task
Grey column = weekend   Red column = holiday   Yellow column / bar = buffer day
--
Buffer: 2 days before Integrate + test, the riskiest step,
because it is the first time all three devs&#x27; work is combined.</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
<element><id>Text</id><coordinates><x>700</x><y>460</y><w>420</w><h>200</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>Q4: Work starts on Monday, January 4, 2027, because January 1 is New Year&#x27;s Day and January 2 and 3 are a weekend. Two buffer days (January 14 and 15) come before integration, the riskiest step.

Q5: The project ends on Wednesday, January 20, 2027.

Q6: The Gantt chart allocates 9 extra days: 6 weekend days, 1 holiday and 2 buffer days.
style=wordwrap
fontsize=13</panel_attributes><additional_attributes/></element>
